Placeholder. Real icon/splash/notification assets will be dropped here before
the first EAS build. Required files (PNG):
  - icon.png             1024x1024 (iOS + store)
  - adaptive-icon.png    1024x1024 (Android foreground)
  - splash.png           1284x2778 (recommended; Expo will letterbox others)
  - notification-icon.png  96x96 (Android status bar — must be monochrome alpha)
  - favicon.png          48x48 (web output; even though web isn't primary)

Until these exist, `expo start` still runs (uses default placeholders), but
`eas build` will fail the validation step.
